  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Defines the contract for an items layout that arranges items in collection and carousel views.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            This interface serves as a marker for classes that define how items are laid out in views like <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.CollectionView" /> and <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.CarouselView" />.
            Implementations include <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.LinearItemsLayout" /> for single-row/column layouts and <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.GridItemsLayout" /> for grid-based layouts.
            The type converter attribute enables XAML parsing of layout specifications.
            </remarks>
